<p>The sting is the <a href="/foundation/logo/">logo’s own motion</a>, composed on a frame’s clock. It is the lockup the site uses — the S and the dot, then the name — so the first frame of every film is the first thing on every page. Three seconds, then it holds; the bumper is 1.2 seconds, the dot and the S and nothing more.</p>
