<h2>The beats</h2>
<div class="im-table-scroll"><table>
<thead><tr><th>At</th><th>What</th><th>How</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>0.0s</td><td>The ground arrives</td><td>The golden pattern fades up (<code>im-studio-ground-golden</code>).</td></tr>
<tr><td>0.4s</td><td>The dot falls</td><td><code>im-logo-fall</code>: from above, lands with a squash, settles on the cap line.</td></tr>
<tr><td>0.9s</td><td>The S rises</td><td><code>im-logo-slot</code>: up through a slot cut on its own baseline.</td></tr>
<tr><td>1.1s</td><td>The tile grows</td><td>The square fills behind the pair and the letter inverts.</td></tr>
<tr><td>1.7s</td><td>The name unfolds</td><td><code>im-studio-sting-rest</code>: “warnil” opens out of the S.</td></tr>
<tr><td>2.1s</td><td>The line writes</td><td><code>im-studio-sting-line</code>: the hand, typed in steps; <code>--im-studio-sting-chars</code> is its length.</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
{{{{code "html"}}}}
<div class="im-studio im-studio-sting" style="--im-studio-w: 1920; --im-studio-h: 1080; --im-studio-sting-chars: 20">
	<span class="im-studio-ground im-studio-ground-golden" aria-hidden="true"></span>
	<div class="im-studio-sting-lockup" role="img" aria-label="Swarnil">
		<span class="im-logo im-logo-mark" aria-hidden="true"><b class="im-logo-type">S</b><i class="im-logo-dot"></i></span>
		<b class="im-studio-sting-rest" aria-hidden="true">warnil</b>
	</div>
	<p class="im-studio-sting-line">Documenting my life.</p>
</div>
{{{{/code}}}}

<h2>The logo’s own motion, on the page</h2>
<p>The same beats are classes on the lockup anywhere — a hero, a loading screen, the footer — documented on the <a href="/foundation/logo/#motion">Logo</a> page: <code>im-logo-type-in</code>, <code>im-logo-drop</code>, <code>im-logo-reveal</code>, <code>im-logo-morph</code>, <code>im-logo-states</code>.</p>
